      "traits": [],
      "entries": [
        "The Queen of Night and Magic casts one of the following spells, using Charisma as the spellcasting ability (spell save DC 23):<br>At will: command, dancing lights, darkness, mage hand, suggestion<br>3/day each: confusion, fear, greater invisibility, mirror image<br>1/day each: dominate monster, plane shift, power word stun"
      ]
