        "symbol": null
      },
      "traits": [],
      "entries": [
        "The Queen of Night and Magic magically teleports, along with any equipment she is wearing or carrying, up to 60 feet to an unoccupied space she can see and takes the Hide action."
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Sudden Fraying",
      "category": "reaction",
      "placement": "reactions",
      "activity": {
        "unit": "reaction",
        "number": 1,
        "symbol": null
      },
      "traits": [],
      "entries": [
        "When the Queen of Night and Magic is targeted by a spell or included in a spell's area and the spell doesn't have an instantaneous duration, she can use Unravel on the spell, dispelling it after it is cast. She doesn't need to see a spell to target it with this reaction, but she must be able to see at least some portion of an area or object affected by the spell."
      ]
    },
